OL,3,GNEWSARoads closed for final race of
OL,4,AClassic TT 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads have closed for a final time this
OL,7,Frace season on the Isle of Man as the
OL,8,F2026 Classic TT races come to an end.
OL,10,FThe 37.7 mile (61km) Mountain Road was
OL,11,Fshut at 09:30 BST, with roads expected
OL,12,Fto reopen no later than 17:00.
OL,14,FThe day's schedule includes the final
OL,15,Frace of the programme ` the Senior
OL,16,FClassic TT ` followed by parade laps.
OL,18,FRacing in the Manx Grand Prix (MGP) and
OL,19,FClassic TT, which run in parallel each
OL,20,FAugust, was brought forward due to rain
OL,21,Fbeing forecast from Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
